{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1125874-hengeyokai-what-is-the-mirror-s-job","id":1125874,"title":"Hengeyokai: What is the Mirror's job?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-08-07T06:09:25-07:00","id":1125874,"title":"Hengeyokai: What is the Mirror's job?","content":"Ok a Theurge is broadly just a shaman, an intermediary between Garou and the spirits. The Mirror shares many Theurge gifts and in some places it seems to state &quot;Functions exactly as a theurge&quot; but in others that its the broad diplomatic job for a Hengeyokai, but it doesn't seem to get extra tools for such. So which is it? And side point if you don't think Mirror is meant to be the diplomat which Auspice would you go with for it for a Hengeyokai who's meant to parlay with spirits, Kuei-jin, westerners etc...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-07T07:44:04-07:00","id":1125906,"title":"","content":"Parlaying with spirits and other beings is also going to be the Mirror. It's kind of like why Eclipses in Exalted 3rd edition can choose Occult as a Caste Ability, and likely facilitated by having Persuasion, among other Gifts, rather than just the Theurge ones. The Pillar will likely help, as is the want of the Pillar. Courtiers will also serve to parlay, but that's on behalf of a court rather than a war party.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpat